<title>SPAIN: Spain's FCC 9-mth attributable up 1.74 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's FCC 9-mth attributable up 1.74 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for Spanish construction group Fomento de Construcciones y Contratas (FCC) in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Pretax profit			   20.79    vs   20.74</p>
<p> Net attributable profit		9.47    up    1.74 pct</p>
<p> Turnover				 311.98    up    1.88 pct</p>
<p>NOTE: FCC said orders pending at September 30 totalled over 1 trillion pesetas for the first time in the firm's history.</p>
<p>Construction orders pending rose 18 percent, and those for environmental and water projects rose 50 percent in the period.</p>
</text>
